our plans</div> </div> </div> </div>I've been watching them for years! Pretty sure I've seen everything they've done, and bought all the movies. lol<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ArcaneArts</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1492893-who-is-your-favorite-youtube-personality-currently?p=1494182#post1494182\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Uhhhhhhhhh.<br /> <br /> Dan Olson, Red and Blue from OSP, Todd in the Shadows, Legal Eagle, Max Miller of Tasting History, The Cinema Therapy Dads, Kyle Kallgren, Bennet the Sage, Geoff Thew of Mother's Basement, The Extra Credits Crew, Renegade Cut, The Slow Mo Guys, Rantasmo, Suede, Gigguk, Maven of the Eventide.</div> </div> </div> </div>Sounds like you watch as much YouTube as I do. Dan Olson is amazing. Renegade Cut is also making some great videos these days.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ArcaneArts</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1492893-who-is-your-favorite-youtube-personality-currently?p=1494182#post1494182\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">RIP Lindsay Ellis's Internet Career, it was unfairly taken.</div> </div> </div> </div>Oh, I know!! I feel bad for her. Hopefully she continues to write though, her two novels are pretty good!<br /> <br /> <br /> As for me, aside from the ones mentioned above, I like Jen