 class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>HorizonParty2021</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1492893-who-is-your-favorite-youtube-personality-currently?p=1494638#post1494638\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Not knowing who she was, I watched almost all (and will likely finish when time permits) of her explanation video.</div> </div> </div> </div>Oh cool! Glad to hear you're enjoying them!<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>HorizonParty2021</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1492893-who-is-your-favorite-youtube-personality-currently?p=1494638#post1494638\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The tweet seemed benign to me. Authors should be able to reach their audience, even those who say legitimately terrible things. AI is powerful enough that a function could be created that groups everyone who is part of an outrage mob and puts their communication on the subject into the recycle bin of the internet. Nobody gets cancelled and everyone is allowed to carry on with their lives.</div> </div> </div> </div>Yea, I didn't think the tweet was a big deal, and seemed like it got blown way out of proportion.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>HorizonParty2021</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1492893-who-is-your-favorite-youtube-personality-currently?p=1494638#post1494638\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Edit: Also, Ampersand is a cool name for an alien.</div> </div> </div> </div>I thought so too! The aliens in that story are pretty interesting too... and it gets better in the sequel.<br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/\" target=\"_blank\">MrGone's Character Sheets</a><br /> For all your WoD Character Sheet Needs<br /> _________________________________<br /> Buy books &amp; pdfs from DTRPG and support my web site! <a href=\"http://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse.php?affiliate_id=55414\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a><br /> Support my site on Patreon! <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/mrgone\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\ude00","count":1},{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24-mr-gone","name":"Mr Gone","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2695"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-10-11T10:12:07-07:00","id":1494793,"title":"","content":"Like it's been said before. People need to grow a thicker skin and learn that there are people who shock &amp; shudder have different viewpoints that you might not like and shouldn't be punished by losing there jobs or be bullied off the internet. Melanie Mc Go Boom mentioned that there were people who were going after her for things she said when she was 17 years old and she is a 35 year old woman now and has a much different mindset now then when she was a teenager.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Power that needs to advertise itself is already losing&quot; Grand Admiral Thrawn <br /> <br /> &quot;Coronation Starscream? This is bad comedy!&quot; Galvatron","edited":{"userid":27361,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27361-lysander","user":"Lysander","date":". 10-12-2022, 02:11 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27361-lysander","name":"Lysander","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27361_11.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3523"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-10-31T02:38:13-07:00","id":1495958,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"left\">I usually watch new clips on the sumerian records label channel and educational videos. My favorite characters are Henning Sanden and Morten Jaeger. They have a great channel about creating animation and they also talk about the basics of art, do podcasts and there's a video Q&amp;A section as well. I work in blender and with their tutorial I was able to make an <u><a href=\"https://darvideo.tv\" target=\"_blank\">animated explainer video</a></u> for my portfolio. I don't have any entertaining favorite characters, I rarely watch anything like that on YouTube.</div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":27589,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27589-seylen","user":"seylen","date":". 10-31-2022, 05:43 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27589-seylen","name":"seylen","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27589_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-10-31T02:39:35-07:00","id":1495959,"title":"","content":"<d